ription": "\n\n**Find Your Flow. Free Your Mind.**\n\n\nMindfula is a visually immersive VR meditation experience designed to guide your mind into a state of flow.\n\n\nInstead of sitting still, you gently move forward through evolving tunnel-like environments \u2014vast nature landscapes, cosmic spaces, kaleidoscopic patterns, and geometric light formations \u2014 synchronized with calming ambient soundscapes.\n\n\nThis continuous motion creates a sense of floating and deep presence, helping quiet mental noise and support relaxation, mindfulness, and focus.\n\n\n### Mindfula is ideal for:\n- Stress relief and mental reset  \n- Mindfulness and relaxation sessions  \n- Visual meditation and flow states  \n- Late-night wind-down or quiet focus time  \n\n\n### Key Features:\n- Automatic forward movement for effortless immersion  \n- Multiple abstract, cosmic, and nature environments\n- High-quality ambient and healing audio  \n\n\n", "short_description": "A flow-based VR meditation experience using gentle motion and evolving visuals to quiet the mind."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://newstory-inc.com/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "New Story Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://newstory-inc.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}, {"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SING